        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We started it because most people who’d love to get out on the water never do.</p><p>For most of us, getting on the water is shorthand for hassle. A hard board you’ve nowhere to store. A roof rack you don’t own. A price tag that turns a summer idea into a someday plan. And a nagging worry that you’ll turn up, wobble off, and never touch it<br/>again.</p><p>We thought that was nonsense.</p><p>So we built the opposite. Boards and kayaks that pack down into a bag, pump up in ten minutes, and are steady enough that a complete beginner can stand up on the first try. Since 2021 more than 4,000 people have reviewed them, at an average of 4.6 out<br/>of 5  -  most of whom would never have called themselves “paddleboard people.” We built the brand for them, and we’re still building it for them.</p><p><em><strong>Tom & Dan, Founders</strong></em></p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
